# `.dockerignore` lives at the *build context* root. The playground's
# Dockerfiles (playground/cloudrun/, playground/runner/) build with the
# repo root as context so their `COPY rustviz-plugin/` etc. paths
# resolve. Without this file, the context would slurp multi-GiB
# target/ + node_modules/ trees on every build.

**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/

.git/
.github/
.vscode/

# Generated mdbook output (per-build, not source)
mdbook-rustviz/test-book/book/

# Frontend caches
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.vite/
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# OS / editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
